## 9. Edge Case Coverage

| Scenario | Handled |
|---|---|
| Quantity = 0 (creation) | ✅ Rejected by `positive()` validation |
| Quantity = 1 | ✅ Accepted |
| Very large quantity (1 billion+) | ✅ Accepted up to `DATABASE_QUANTITY_MAX` (2^31-1) |
| Negative quantity | ✅ Rejected by validation |
| Empty product name | ✅ Rejected (`min: 2`) |
| Very long product name | ✅ Truncated at 160 chars |
| Missing price | ✅ Defaults to 0 |
| Invalid price | ✅ Zod coerce + `nonNegativeMoney` |
| Duplicate product (SKU) | ✅ P2002 → 409 `SKU_ALREADY_EXISTS` |
| Product with no transactions | ✅ Hard delete on removal |
| Product with transaction history | ✅ Soft archive on removal |
| Concurrent stock modifications | ✅ Serializable isolation + guarded decrement |
| Expired auth session | ✅ `sessionExpiresAt` check in `getCurrentUser()` |
| Password reuse during reset | ✅ bcrypt compare before accepting new password |
| Deleted user mid-session | ✅ Returns null → redirect/401 |
| Invalid JSON body | ✅ Returns 400 `INVALID_JSON` |
| Oversized body | ✅ Returns 413 (20KB limit) |
| Wrong content type | ✅ Returns 415 `UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE` |

